Provides: editor
Description: Vi IMproved with native GitHub Copilot support
 A fork of Vim 9.2 that implements GitHub Copilot directly in the C core, with
 no plugin manager, no VimScript shim and no Node.js runtime.
 .
 The editor talks to a Copilot language server over Vim's built-in LSP channel
 mode and adds chat, inline ghost-text completions, and an agent mode.
 .
 The proprietary Copilot language server is not included in public source
 packages.  Configure 'copilotcommand' to point to an executable obtained
 separately.